(6119024, 901466, 72318, '<td valign="top">Is it really?  Notwithstanding the creative use of the word "operator" with the title the shot itself isnt very aesthetically pleasing.  It seems devoid of a strong composition and could do with a bit of contrast, two major things to think about when taking a black and white photo. Sorry if that was harsh, but that is the way i see it... I''d be lying otherwise.</td>', 'Is it really?  Notwithstanding the creative use of the word "operator" with the title the shot itself isnt very aesthetically pleasing.  It seems devoid of a strong composition and could do with a bit of contrast, two major things to think about when taking a black and white photo. Sorry if that was harsh, but that is the way i see it... I''d be lying otherwise.', '2010-08-05 07:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6119034, 901481, 72318, '<td valign="top">I like the simple concept - could be cleaner with the wire, but otherwise gets a good score from me :)</td>', 'I like the simple concept - could be cleaner with the wire, but otherwise gets a good score from me :)', '2010-08-05 07:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6119035, 901409, 72318, '<td valign="top">A very niche company might actually buy this if it fit their advertising.  So not sre about the "stock" side of the challenge, nevertheless, great concept and execution!</td>', 'A very niche company might actually buy this if it fit their advertising.  So not sre about the "stock" side of the challenge, nevertheless, great concept and execution!', '2010-08-05 07:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6119037, 901541, 72318, '<td valign="top">Everything is great about this, except for the composition, there is seemingly a redundant space in the top left.  If that were reserved for text space then the background pattern isnt useful. I''d probably have cropped it to the where the wire exits the frame.</td>', 'Everything is great about this, except for the composition, there is seemingly a redundant space in the top left.  If that were reserved for text space then the background pattern isnt useful. I''d probably have cropped it to the where the wire exits the frame.', '2010-08-05 07:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6119038, 901302, 72318, '<td valign="top">Grrr!  Probably more for the other side to the operator as a stock photo, but great concept and execution.</td>', 'Grrr!  Probably more for the other side to the operator as a stock photo, but great concept and execution.', '2010-08-05 07:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6119039, 901548, 72318, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean asa stock photo should be, good exposure, although possibly a little too "smooth".  Still, one of the better photos in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice and clean asa stock photo should be, good exposure, although possibly a little too "smooth".  Still, one of the better photos in the challenge.', '2010-08-05 07:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
