(6123567, 901541, 62249, '<td valign="top">Looks like a classic stock photo. Well composed. Maybe use slightly shallower DOF to blur the background blinds more.</td>', 'Looks like a classic stock photo. Well composed. Maybe use slightly shallower DOF to blur the background blinds more.', '2010-08-08 20:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
