(6125061, 901466, 100831, '<td valign="top">hmph. Okay, so I learned a new word. Now what do I do?<br/>As an image, this is glorious. I love the way the lights hits all the little faces in different directions. And I''m really enjoying the fact that it isn''t flat. But as a stock operator photo? Well, I didn''t even try to enter the challenge so I''ll give you that. 8</td>', 'hmph. Okay, so I learned a new word. Now what do I do?As an image, this is glorious. I love the way the lights hits all the little faces in different directions. And I''m really enjoying the fact that it isn''t flat. But as a stock operator photo? Well, I didn''t even try to enter the challenge so I''ll give you that. 8', '2010-08-09 20:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125155, 901459, 62895, '<td valign="top">My top rated in the challenge. I like the concept and it''s a bit different from anything else in the challenge.</td>', 'My top rated in the challenge. I like the concept and it''s a bit different from anything else in the challenge.', '2010-08-09 21:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
