(6125158, 901323, 62895, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and I like the feel of the image. Sort of Norman Rockwell. It''s clean enough that I think it could also work nicely as a stock image.</td>', 'Nice lighting, and I like the feel of the image. Sort of Norman Rockwell. It''s clean enough that I think it could also work nicely as a stock image.', '2010-08-09 21:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
