(6126214, 901481, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm..<br/> <br/>It''s nice, but the black areas really hurt this image - my eye is more drawn to the lower right corner than it is the subject, and that''s certainly not a good thing.  still, despite the issues, your concept is very good, and the image illustrates that idea well... 6</td>', 'Hmm.. It''s nice, but the black areas really hurt this image - my eye is more drawn to the lower right corner than it is the subject, and that''s certainly not a good thing.  still, despite the issues, your concept is very good, and the image illustrates that idea well... 6', '2010-08-10 18:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126221, 901597, 112828, '<td valign="top">Fun and creative, the lighting isn''t really to my taste, as the subject IMO needs more fill lighting, (and your surface is dirty, why in the world didn''t you clone those out?) 6</td>', 'Fun and creative, the lighting isn''t really to my taste, as the subject IMO needs more fill lighting, (and your surface is dirty, why in the world didn''t you clone those out?) 6', '2010-08-10 18:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
