(6126248, 901511, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm..<br/> <br/>I think you my have confused the word "Operator" with "Sales Person"..<br/> <br/>Then again, perhaps you are attempting to show a person on the other end of the phone, the "customer" who is talking to the operator..<br/> <br/>Well, in any case, the image does not strike me as a "stock" type image, I really hesitated to go as low as a 4 on this, but I''m afraid I must...</td>', 'Hmm.. I think you my have confused the word "Operator" with "Sales Person".. Then again, perhaps you are attempting to show a person on the other end of the phone, the "customer" who is talking to the operator.. Well, in any case, the image does not strike me as a "stock" type image, I really hesitated to go as low as a 4 on this, but I''m afraid I must...', '2010-08-10 18:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
