(6126266, 901466, 112828, '<td valign="top"><b>Sooo DNMC</b>.  <br/> <br/>My fiancee holds a B.S. in math, and I also enjoyed far too many math classes as a science major, so I''m certainly not ignorant as to what you''re trying to say here, and I do enjoy the word play very much. <br/> <br/>I think this location could prove to be a great place to get some very nice images for future challenges, as that pattern is really great..  Your choice of B&amp;W processing really suits this image well, and your lighting is also very good.<br/> <br/>DOF is a little shallow (nearest is slightly OOF) and your border isn''t helping this image. <br/> <br/>However, as I''m judging this image as an entry in the "Stock Photos: The Operator" challenge, this strikes me as sophistic and shoe-horny.  *shrug*</td>', 'Sooo DNMC.   My fiancee holds a B.S. in math, and I also enjoyed far too many math classes as a science major, so I''m certainly not ignorant as to what you''re trying to say here, and I do enjoy the word play very much.  I think this location could prove to be a great place to get some very nice images for future challenges, as that pattern is really great..  Your choice of B&W processing really suits this image well, and your lighting is also very good. DOF is a little shallow (nearest is slightly OOF) and your border isn''t helping this image.  However, as I''m judging this image as an entry in the "Stock Photos: The Operator" challenge, this strikes me as sophistic and shoe-horny.  *shrug*', '2010-08-10 18:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
