(6127323, 901548, 17507, '<td valign="top">Second Niall''s comment - this is a conceptually strong photo and makes a welcome jab at the epidemic of infuriating phone trees. (A lot of them you can just pound 9, 0, or # to get to a real person, but that doesn''t always work... and even more than traditional ones, I can''t stand the ones that require you to speak phrases to a robot.) Anyway, congrats on top ten!</td>', 'Second Niall''s comment - this is a conceptually strong photo and makes a welcome jab at the epidemic of infuriating phone trees. (A lot of them you can just pound 9, 0, or # to get to a real person, but that doesn''t always work... and even more than traditional ones, I can''t stand the ones that require you to speak phrases to a robot.) Anyway, congrats on top ten!', '2010-08-11 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
